{"publicId":"e5dc0e47-bd14-4756-ac2e-5178ea2a4c3f","title":"高收益成长股MPLX收益率提升至8.5%但ET最新数据未披露","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-11T22:43:43.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-11T22:43:43.000Z","digest":"【核心结论】新分析师在2026-11-12补充称MPLX当前收益率已达8.5%（早先为8%+），并维持12%+年化增长预期；ET最新收益率数据未更新\n\n【背景与分歧】原分析（2026-11-05）基于Richard Drury个人持仓（未披露财务数据）称MPLX和ET收益率均超8%，预计年化回报12%-15%。新报道（作者持有MPLX/NVDA仓位）仅更新MPLX数据至8.5%，未提及ET当前收益率是否仍超8%，且未补充任何财务指标或估值调整依据。\n\n【影响范围】两份报告均来自Seeking Alpha平台，但新报告未更新ET关键指标，可能影响投资者对两家公司风险收益比的综合判断。原分析中未披露的财务数据（如派息覆盖率）在新报告中仍未补充，需结合后续披露验证。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-11T22:57:42.464Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"MPLX: 高达 8.5% 收益率与 12% 以上增长使其成为买入选择","latestReport":{"id":"on0k8a5df23cimoowqo2jhj3y"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fjfOfSDAQLsg","title":"MPLX: Huge 8.5% Yield, Juicy 12%+ Growth Make It A Buy","firstReportAt":"2026-11-11T22:43:43.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"on0k8a5df23cimoowqo2jhj3y","title":"MPLX: 高达 8.5% 收益率与 12% 以上增长使其成为买入选择","summary":"MPLX 具有 8.5% 的高收益率和 12% 以上的增长潜力，分析师建议买入。","source":{"name":"Seeking Alpha","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T22:43:43.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"on0k8a5df23cimoowqo2jhj3y","title":"MPLX: 高达 8.5% 收益率与 12% 以上增长使其成为买入选择","summary":"MPLX 具有 8.5% 的高收益率和 12% 以上的增长潜力，分析师建议买入。","source":{"name":"Seeking Alpha","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T22:43:43.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-05T14:00:00.000Z","heat":9.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-05T16:00:00.000Z","heat":8.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","heat":8.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-05T18:00:00.000Z","heat":8.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-05T19:00:00.000Z","heat":8.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-05T20:00:00.000Z","heat":8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-05T21:00:00.000Z","heat":7.